-- הסכם עוז לתמורה (14.8.2011), §12 שעות גיל: the age reduction of hours
-- stays as it was, and comes off the frontal hours only; the teacher does
-- every individual, teaching-support and role hour his position asks.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT `oz-founding-common`
IMPORT `oz-founding-9`
IMPORT `oz-founding-annex-b`

§ `12 שעות גיל`

-- ¶1: the rules on reducing hours for age do not change: how many hours
-- they take off, by age and position, is theirs (an input). The reduction
-- comes off the frontal teaching hours only, by the position; the teacher
-- does all the individual and teaching-support hours of his position, and
-- his role hours if any, in the school.
@ref akn:art_12
GIVEN w IS A `Oz work week`, `the age reduction by the rules` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `Oz work week`
DECIDE `the Oz week after the age reduction` w `the age reduction by the rules` IS
    `an Oz week of`
        (w's `frontal teaching hours` MINUS `the age reduction by the rules`)
        (w's `individual hours with pupils`)
        (w's `teaching-support hours`)

`why the age reduction is an input` MEANS
    `set elsewhere` "הכללים בדבר הפחתת שעות בשל גיל, כפי שהם"

-- ¶2: the week of a teacher entitled to the full age reduction is set out
-- in annex ב' (oz-founding-annex-b): by his age band and his frontal hours,
-- with homeroom and role hours, the week and the position its tables give.
@ref akn:art_12/p2
GIVEN band IS AN `Oz annexed age band` @desc the band the age-reduction rules put him in
      `frontal hours, with homeroom and role hours` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE `Oz annexed week`
DECIDE `the week of a teacher entitled to the full age reduction` band `frontal hours, with homeroom and role hours` IS
    `what annex ב' gives a teacher with` band `frontal hours, with homeroom and role hours`

-- Annex ב's first column from 50 to 55 (22 frontal, 6 individual, 10
-- teaching-support hours, 38 hours in the school) is the full week less 2
-- frontal hours, and its first column over 55 (20, 6, 10, 36) the full
-- week less 4: the checks below hold ¶1 to them.
GIVEN `the age reduction by the rules` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the hours in the school after a full-position age reduction of` `the age reduction by the rules` IS
    `the hours of the Oz week` (`the Oz week after the age reduction` `the Oz full-position week` `the age reduction by the rules`)

#ASSERT `the Oz week after the age reduction` `the Oz full-position week` 2 EQUALS `an Oz week of` 22 6 10
#ASSERT `the hours in the school after a full-position age reduction of` 2 EQUALS 38
#ASSERT `the hours in the school after a full-position age reduction of` 4 EQUALS 36
#ASSERT `the week of the annexed table's full position` `the table of annex ב' from 50 to 55` EQUALS JUST (`the Oz week after the age reduction` `the Oz full-position week` 2)
#ASSERT `the week of the annexed table's full position` `the table of annex ב' over 55` EQUALS JUST (`the Oz week after the age reduction` `the Oz full-position week` 4)
#ASSERT `the full position's hours in the annexed table` `the table of annex ב' from 50 to 55` EQUALS `the hours in the school after a full-position age reduction of` 2
#ASSERT `the week of a teacher entitled to the full age reduction` `the Oz band over 55` 20 EQUALS JUST (`an Oz annexed week of` (`an Oz week of` 20 6 10) (100%) (100%))
